"The model loads when the overlay is turned on or a region readout starts."
msgstr ""
"Model se načte po zapnutí překryvu nebo při spuštění výpočtu statistik "
"oblasti."

#. Translators: cells are the small squares of the slide
#. that are predicted at once.
#: src/present.rs:1321
msgid "{n} cell in view could not be computed"
msgid_plural "{n} cells in view could not be computed"
msgstr[0] "{n} políčko v zobrazení nelze vypočítat"
msgstr[1] "{n} políčka v zobrazení nelze vypočítat"
msgstr[2] "{n} políček v zobrazení nelze vypočítat"

#. Translators: {} is how long each window (square image
#. the model predicts from) takes, in seconds.
#: src/present.rs:1333
msgid "Computing · {} s per window"
msgstr "Výpočet · {} s na okno"

#. Translators: {} is the name of the model that is loaded.
#: src/present.rs:1344
msgid "Ready: {}"
msgstr "Připraveno: {}"

#: src/present.rs:1367
msgid "No slide"
msgstr "Žádný preparát"

#. Translators: the slide's pixel size in micrometres per pixel
#. (µm/px), the pyramid level it is read from, and how much
#. smaller that level is (×4.00).
#: src/present.rs:1374
msgid "{x} × {y} µm/px, read from level {level} (×{downsample})"
msgstr "{x} × {y} µm/px, čteno z úrovně {level} (×{downsample})"

#. Translators: the slide does not say its pixel size.
#: src/present.rs:1385
msgid "pixel size not reported"
msgstr "velikost pixelu není uvedena"

#. Translators: under the progress bar in the Cellaris panel; a
#. cell is one square of the grid the slide is predicted in, not a
#. biological cell.
#: src/present.rs:1418
msgid "{done} of {n} cell in view"
msgid_plural "{done} of {n} cells in view"
msgstr[0] "{done} z {n} políčka v zobrazení"
msgstr[1] "{done} z {n} políček v zobrazení"
msgstr[2] "{done} z {n} políček v zobrazení"

#. Translators: {} is a marker's display window ("arcsinh 4.50–6.50")
#. that the user set.
#: src/present.rs:1446
msgid "{}, yours"
msgstr "{}, vlastní"

#. Translators: eov first asks the user whether to download the model
#. (nothing is downloaded without that answer), then downloads it.
#: src/present.rs:1512
msgid ""
"eov is asking you whether to download the model, or downloading it (see the "
"status bar)…"
msgstr ""
"eov se vás ptá, zda model stáhnout, nebo jej stahuje (viz stavový řádek)…"

#. Translators: under the model's address and SHA-256 in the
#. Cellaris panel; the model store is where eov keeps models.
#: src/present.rs:1521
msgid ""
"eov checks the download against this SHA-256 and keeps it in its model "
"store; it is then Cellaris's model. Without an address, the copy your "
"administrator gave eov is used."
msgstr ""
"eov ověří stažený soubor podle tohoto SHA-256 a uloží jej do svého úložiště "
"modelů; poté jej Cellaris používá jako svůj model. Bez adresy se použije "
"kopie, kterou programu eov poskytl váš správce."

#. Translators: where an ONNX Runtime library was found, shown in
#. parentheses after it in the list of libraries tried.
#: src/runtime.rs:128
msgid "the runtime chosen in the Cellaris panel"
msgstr "běhové prostředí zvolené v panelu Cellaris"

#: src/runtime.rs:129
msgid "the plugin package"
msgstr "balíček zásuvného modulu"

#: src/runtime.rs:130
msgid "the plugin's data directory"
msgstr "datová složka zásuvného modulu"

#: src/runtime.rs:131
msgid "the system library path"
msgstr "systémová cesta ke knihovnám"

#. Translators: {} is the path the user chose for the ONNX
#. Runtime library.
#: src/runtime.rs:142
msgid ""
"the runtime chosen in the Cellaris panel points at {}, which does not exist"
msgstr ""
"běhové prostředí zvolené v panelu Cellaris odkazuje na cestu {}, která "
"neexistuje"

#. Translators: {source} is an environment variable or a
#. command-line option (not translated), {path} a path.
#: src/runtime.rs:150
